      "versionNonce": 2052339778,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786448061741,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Gerekli testleri yap\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra \u00FCcretli kullanc\u0131lara a\u00E7\u0131lmas\u0131",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Gerekli testleri yap\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra \u00FCcretli kullanc\u0131lara a\u00E7\u0131lmas\u0131",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cFrWH3hBqTfJY2qeLFRad",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 236.4212823548454,
      "y": 639.8024508886297,
      "width": 524.1796264648438,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1785717219,
      "version": 490,
      "versionNonce": 1634197506,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786448061741,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u015Euan ki hesaplar\u0131n deneme hesab\u0131 oldu\u011Funu ay\u0131rt etme ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u015Euan ki hesaplar\u0131n deneme hesab\u0131 oldu\u011Funu ay\u0131rt etme ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Qmw7rD5S4LKtWvkJQY8zM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 236.4212823548454,
      "y": 697.8024508886297,
      "width": 1348.4190673828125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2035836963,
      "version": 536,
      "versionNonce": 1060147138,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786448061741,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kurulum taraf\u0131nda en az 1 alan doldurumas\u0131n\u0131n yeterli olmas\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 bu alanda s\u0131kmamak ya da kullan\u0131c\u0131ya atla diyebiliyor olmam\u0131z gerekiyor",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kurulum taraf\u0131nda en az 1 alan doldurumas\u0131n\u0131n yeterli olmas\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 bu alanda s\u0131kmamak ya da kullan\u0131c\u0131ya atla diyebiliyor olmam\u0131z gerekiyor",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QDF7uLpUo3fc8oaUp1_2c",
      "type": "text",
